Pi Desktop
==========

A desktop GUI shell for the pi coding agent.

This product includes code derived from the following open-source projects:

ClawX
-----
Limited Electron infrastructure in this software (the typed host-api IPC
boundary and registry, preload allowlist patterns, Vite Electron bootstrap,
and Streamdown Markdown configuration) is adapted from ClawX,
Copyright (c) ValueCell Team, licensed under the MIT License. Other desktop
layout and testing patterns were used as design references. Source comments
and individual commit messages identify ported or inspired file paths where
applicable.

pi (pi-mono)
------------
Pi Desktop integrates with, but does not bundle or copy code from,
the pi coding agent (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent),
Copyright (c) Mario Zechner, licensed under the MIT License.
pi is provided by the user's own environment installation.

Both projects are used in accordance with the MIT License terms.
